                        target="frus1944v05#pg_681">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1944, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>, pp. 681</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus1944v05#pg_740">740</ref>, respectively.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
